# The build context is the repository root; the image needs the workspace
# root files and apps/web only. Never the host's node_modules or build output.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/web/
!storybook/nginx.conf
**/node_modules
apps/web/.next
apps/web/storybook-static
apps/web/coverage
apps/web/.env
apps/web/.env.*
